          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "Some indeed preach Christ even out of envy and strife, and some also out of good will.",
      "ko": "어떤이들은 투기와 분쟁으로, 어떤이들은 착한 뜻으로 그리스도를 전파하나니",
      "source_text_hash": "2c798ebe7884bdf2a12dbdb330e62a1b24b13de712addd93577d332a7f3a97c6",
      "translation_text_hash": "aaf8bea9537986cfbfbb748c571b08d252c6945c16c9ad763649c656543cea1e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "어떤이들은 투기와 분쟁으로, 어떤이들은 착한 뜻으로 그리스도를 전파하나니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "aaf8bea9537986cfbfbb748c571b08d252c6945c16c9ad763649c656543cea1e"
      ]
    },
    {
