      "en": "For to me to live is Christ, and to die is gain.",
      "ko": "이는 내게 사는 것이 그리스도니 죽는 것도 유익함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a3f8047ad88a5a6b7ab26bf09a074037e1f92aa5cd18e04c24b5d3022fe620f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "5aa8d9112fc1aae260be4704c41aaec1c03784db3d86c9380eb71dee98233a4d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
